# Nexora Downloader - Netlify deployment
# Required to sign temporary media links and enable the best-effort video limiter.
# Generate locally: openssl rand -hex 32
# In Netlify: Project configuration > Environment variables > DOWNLOAD_SECRET
# Never expose secret values in browser JavaScript or commit them to GitHub.
DOWNLOAD_SECRET=

# No external database or media proxy services.
# Video delivery on Netlify uses HTTP 302 redirect to the HTTPS provider.
# Best-effort 4 videos per IP per 24h uses warm function-process memory only.
# It is NOT a globally consistent quota across Netlify instances or redeploys.
